BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:647a006b-d86f-4650-a4e2-475138b63e53@12wk-health-plan
SUMMARY:Week 1: Workout A — Legs + Push + Core
DTSTART:20260615T100000
DTEND:20260615T105500
DESCRIPTION:Weeks 1–2: 2 sets only\, deliberately light.\nGoal is attenda
 nce and form — not effort. You should finish feeling "I could have done 
 more."\n\nKNEE RULES: pain <=3/10 that settles in 24h = OK. Control the lo
 wering phase: 2–3 sec down every rep.\n\nExercises:\n  Bike warm-up: 5
 –8 min  [Easy pace]\n  Leg press: 3 × 10–12  [Knees to ~90°\, feet s
 lightly high on plate\, start light]\n  Seated hamstring curl: 3 × 10–1
 2  [Critical for ACL protection — never skip]\n  Chest press machine: 3 
 × 8–12\n  Seated cable row: 3 × 8–12\n  Plank: 3 × 20–40 s
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT30M
DESCRIPTION:Reminder
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4cf66d66-c86e-40b4-84af-70ceb2bbdb75@12wk-health-plan
SUMMARY:Week 1: Workout B — Hinge + Glutes + Pull + Shoulders
DTSTART:20260617T100000
DTEND:20260617T105500
DESCRIPTION:Weeks 1–2: 2 sets only\, deliberately light.\nGoal is attenda
 nce and form — not effort. You should finish feeling "I could have done 
 more."\n\nKNEE RULES: pain <=3/10 that settles in 24h = OK. Control the lo
 wering phase: 2–3 sec down every rep.\n\nExercises:\n  Bike warm-up: 5
 –8 min\n  Dumbbell Romanian deadlift: 3 × 8–10  [Light\, soft knees\,
  hinge at hips]\n  Hip abduction machine: 3 × 12–15  [Glute med support
 s the knee]\n  Lat pulldown: 3 × 8–12\n  Machine shoulder press: 3 × 8
 –12\n  Glute bridge (floor): 3 × 12–15\n  Standing calf raise: 3 × 1
 2–15
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT30M
DESCRIPTION:Reminder
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
